OL,3,GNEWSABurglar who attacked pensioner,
OL,4,A79, during 'sustained assault' jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man, who subjected an elderly couple
OL,7,Fto such a traumatic ordeal during an
OL,8,Fattempted burglary that they are now
OL,9,Ftoo afraid to return to their home of
OL,10,F45 years, has been jailed.
OL,12,FKevin Edward Quigley, 45, from Rosses
OL,13,FGate in Londonderry, admitted the
OL,14,Fburglary at the couple's home on April
OL,15,F6 last year and assaulting a
OL,16,F79-year-old man.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
