OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABurglar who attacked pensioner,
OL,4,A79, during 'sustained assault' jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondonderry Magistrates' Court heard
OL,7,Fthat the elderly resident was subjected
OL,8,Fto a "sustained assault" and that both
OL,9,Fhe and his 78-year-old wife were
OL,10,Ftreated at Altnagelvin Hospital
OL,11,Ffollowing the incident.
OL,13,FThe court heard the couple were so
OL,14,Ftraumatised by the incident that they
OL,15,Fhave not returned to their home and are
OL,16,Fcurrently living with a family member.
